          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"about.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg1:#0f1724;--bg2:#102938;--accent:#b18aff;--muted:#9aa4b2;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.06)}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;color:#e6eef8;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg1) 0%,var(--bg2) 60%);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:22px 36px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}\\n    .logo{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#6fd3ff);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#071022;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.45)}\\n    nav a{color:rgba(230,238,248,0.9);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;opacity:0.95}\\n    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:28px;border-radius:16px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;align-items:center}\\n    .hero h1{font-size:40px;margin:0 0 10px 0;letter-spacing:-0.02em}\\n    .hero p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .card{background:var(--glass);padding:20px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted)}\\n    section{margin-top:22px}\\n    .pillars{display:flex;gap:14px}\\n    .pillar{flex:1;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .faq-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}\\n    .cta{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#6fd3ff);color:#071022;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    .btn-ghost{color:var(--muted);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none}\\n    footer{padding:28px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    /* Background motif — inline SVG for sensory ripple */\\n    .bg-svg{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;opacity:0.12}\\n    .note{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    @media(max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.pillars{flex-direction:column}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <svg class=\\\"bg-svg\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 1600 900\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"xMidYMid slice\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n    <defs>\\n      <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#2b1a4d\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#0b3a5b\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n      <filter id=\\\"blur\\\"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\\\"40\\\"/></filter>\\n      <radialGradient id=\\\"r1\\\" cx=\\\"30%\\\" cy=\\\"40%\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#b18aff\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.6\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#6fd3ff\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.06\\\"/></radialGradient>\\n      <pattern id=\\\"dot\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"40\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\"><circle cx=\\\"2\\\" cy=\\\"2\\\" r=\\\"1.1\\\" fill=\\\"#ffffff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.03\\\"/></pattern>\\n    </defs>\\n    <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\"/>\\n    <g filter=\\\"url(#blur)\\\">\\n      <circle cx=\\\"420\\\" cy=\\\"220\\\" r=\\\"240\\\" fill=\\\"url(#r1)\\\"/>\\n      <circle cx=\\\"1160\\\" cy=\\\"700\\\" r=\\\"300\\\" fill=\\\"url(#r1)\\\"/>\\n    </g>\\n    <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#dot)\\\"/>\\n  </svg>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"brand\\\" style=\\\"z-index:2\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"logo\\\">SB</div>\\n      <div style=\\\"line-height:1\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"note\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav style=\\\"z-index:2\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Gatherings</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"events.html\\\">Next Sessions</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"private-sessions.html\\\">Private</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">The Story</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Reserve</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Contact</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"wrap\\\" style=\\\"position:relative;z-index:2\\\">\\n    <!-- HERO -->\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\" id=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h1>We design sound for presence — a curated bath to rest the nervous system</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Rooted in careful listening, our sessions blend field-calibrated instruments and intentional pacing to invite deep relaxation in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.</p>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\" class=\\\"cta\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"events.html\\\">Upcoming dates</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <aside class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">About the facilitator</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Led by {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}, a certified sound therapist blending contemplative practices and modern somatic techniques.</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\" class=\\\"note\\\"><strong>Venue:</strong> {{VENUE_NAME}} • <strong>Phone:</strong> {{PHONE}}</div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- PILLARS (first variation) -->\\n    <section id=\\\"pillars\\\" class=\\\"pillars\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"pillars-heading\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"pillar\\\">\\n        <h3 id=\\\"pillars-heading\\\">Supportive Architecture</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">We stage sound like light — shapes and textures that guide attention without forcing it. Sessions follow a clear arc so each person can arrive and unwind safely.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"pillar\\\">\\n        <h3>Instrument Craft</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">We favour crystalline resonance: crystal singing bowls, gentle tuning forks, and Himalayan chimes tuned for rich harmonic fullness.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"pillar\\\">\\n        <h3>Intentional Safety</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Accessibility and contraindications are prioritized. We adapt volume, position, and techniques to meet individual needs.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- MYTH vs TRUTH -->\\n    <section id=\\\"myth\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\">\\n      <h2>Common myths and what actually happens</h2>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Myth:</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Sound baths are hypnotic shows where you lose control.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Truth:</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">They are guided experiences that support conscious presence. You remain fully embodied and can come and go; the facilitator cues breath and space.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Myth:</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Lying down is mandatory.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Truth:</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">You may sit, recline, or lie—whatever your body needs. Comfort always comes first.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- CASE NOTES -->\\n    <section id=\\\"case-notes\\\">\\n      <h2>How a session flows</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Example structure — a careful scaffolding for nervous system reset:</div>\\n      <ol style=\\\"margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n        <li>Arrival & orientation: 10–12 minutes to settle, choose props and positioning.</li>\\n        <li>Opening tone & breath cue: gentle introduction to the sonic space.</li>\\n        <li>Main sound journey: 25–35 minutes of layered instruments (crystal bowls, tuning forks, Himalayan chimes).</li>\\n        <li>Gradual return: soft grounding tones and a short integration period with space to journal or share.</li>\\n      </ol>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <strong>What to bring</strong>\\n        <ul class=\\\"muted\\\">\\n          <li>Yoga mat or blanket for warmth</li>\\n          <li>Small pillow or bolster for head/neck support</li>\\n          <li>Eye covering or scarf</li>\\n          <li>Water bottle</li>\\n        </ul>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\"><strong>Contraindications:</strong> If you have a history of epilepsy, photosensitive conditions, serious cardiac implants, or are in the first trimester of pregnancy, please consult a physician and contact us in advance at {{EMAIL}}.</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- FAQ (short) -->\\n    <section id=\\\"faq-sm\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\">\\n      <h2>Questions you might have</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"faq-list\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Do I need experience?</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">No. Sessions are suitable for first-timers and seasoned practitioners alike.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>How loud is it?</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Volumes are moderated for comfort; we use dynamic shaping, not sustained high decibels.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- CTA -->\\n    <section id=\\\"book\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h3>Ready to arrive?</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Reserve a spot for the next public session or ask about private work in {{CITY}}.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book a Session</a>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"contact.html\\\" style=\\\"margin-left:10px\\\">Questions</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer>\\n    <div>{{VENUE_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n  </footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"faq.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>FAQ — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#071022;--card:#071a2b;--accent:#7be3c7;--muted:#9fb0c3}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;color:#e9fbf8;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#071226)}\\n    header{padding:18px 28px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    nav a{color:#d8f8f2;text-decoration:none;margin-left:16px}\\n    .container{max-width:1000px;margin:18px auto;padding:20px}\\n    .hero{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:22px;border-radius:12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    .hero h1{margin:0}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:20px}\\n    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:16px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .faq-item{margin-bottom:12px}\\n    details{background:var(--card);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    summary{font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}\\n    .aside .card{position:sticky;top:28px}\\n    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    .btn-accent{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#7be3c7,#6fb8ff);color:#03121a}\\n    svg.bg{position:fixed;right:-10%;top:-10%;width:720px;opacity:0.08;filter:blur(10px);pointer-events:none}\\n    @media(max-width:900px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.aside .card{position:static}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <svg class=\\\"bg\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 600 600\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n    <defs>\\n      <linearGradient id=\\\"lg\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#7be3c7\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#6fb8ff\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n      <pattern id=\\\"grid\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\"><rect width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"2\\\" cy=\\\"2\\\" r=\\\"1\\\" fill=\\\"#ffffff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.02\\\"/></pattern>\\n    </defs>\\n    <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#grid)\\\"/>\\n    <circle cx=\\\"200\\\" cy=\\\"200\\\" r=\\\"180\\\" fill=\\\"url(#lg)\\\"/>\\n  </svg>\\n\\n  <header>\\n    <div style=\\\"color:#eafff2;font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"events.html\\\">Events</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"private-sessions.html\\\">Private</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Reserve</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h1>Questions about attending a sound bath</h1>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Concise answers to help you plan — from what to bring to safety considerations.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\" class=\\\"btn btn-accent\\\">Reserve Now</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <section class=\\\"card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"faq-main\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom:14px\\\">\\n          <h2 id=\\\"faq-main\\\">Frequently asked</h2>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n              <details>\\n                <summary>Do I need to bring anything special?</summary>\\n                <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Bring a mat or blanket, a small pillow, a light cover, and water. We provide a limited number of bolsters; bring your own if you prefer.</div>\\n              </details>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n              <details>\\n                <summary>What instruments will be used?</summary>\\n                <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">This venue's palette often includes a gong for layered undertones, a monochord to create gentle drones, and crystal bowls for shimmering harmonics.</div>\\n              </details>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n              <details>\\n                <summary>Can I leave early?</summary>\\n                <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Yes. Sessions are non-invasive. If you need to exit, do so quietly — facilitators can suggest a discreet path.</div>\\n              </details>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n              <details>\\n                <summary>Are sessions therapeutic?</summary>\\n                <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">We offer restorative experiences, not psychotherapy. If you seek clinical therapy, please consult a licensed practitioner alongside this work.</div>\\n              </details>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3>Safety & contraindications</h3>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">If you have implanted medical devices, are pregnant in the first trimester, have epilepsy, or are currently experiencing acute psychiatric symptoms, contact us before booking. For tailored guidance email {{EMAIL}}.</p>\\n        </section>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"aside\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h4>About attending</h4>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Arrive 10–15 minutes early to settle. Wear layers. Keep phones off or on airplane mode to preserve the field.</p>\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">Pricing snapshot</h4>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Public sessions and private work available. Visit pricing.html or contact us to discuss bulk bookings for teams.</p>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a href=\\\"contact.html\\\" class=\\\"btn\\\">Ask us</a></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h3>Still have other questions?</h3>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Email us at <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> or call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a>.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\" class=\\\"btn btn-accent\\\">Book a spot</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer style=\\\"text-align:center;color:var(--muted);padding:18px\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{VENUE_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"book.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Reserve — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#07121a;--card:#081827;--accent:#ffd68a;--muted:#bfcad2}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;color:#fff;background:radial-gradient(circle at 10% 10%,#0b2330 0%,#051018 40%,#041018 100%)}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:18px 26px}\\n    nav a{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);text-decoration:none;margin-left:14px}\\n    .container{max-width:900px;margin:20px auto;padding:24px}\\n    .hero{padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent)}\\n    form{margin-top:16px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:18px;border-radius:12px}\\n    label{display:block;margin-bottom:8px;font-weight:700}\\n    input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:transparent;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}\\n    .footnote{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:8px}\\n    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#ff9f6b);color:#07121a}\\n    .meta{margin-top:14px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    svg.pattern{position:fixed;left:0;bottom:0;width:420px;opacity:0.08;pointer-events:none}\\n    @media(max-width:720px){.row{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <svg class=\\\"pattern\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 600 400\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n    <defs>\\n      <linearGradient id=\\\"b\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#ffd68a\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#ff9f6b\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n      <pattern id=\\\"squares\\\" width=\\\"30\\\" height=\\\"30\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\"><rect width=\\\"30\\\" height=\\\"30\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"3\\\" cy=\\\"3\\\" r=\\\"1\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.02\\\"/></pattern>\\n    </defs>\\n    <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#squares)\\\"/>\\n    <ellipse cx=\\\"260\\\" cy=\\\"200\\\" rx=\\\"220\\\" ry=\\\"120\\\" fill=\\\"url(#b)\\\"/>\\n  </svg>\\n\\n  <header>\\n    <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Overview</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"events.html\\\">Attend</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"private-sessions.html\\\">Private Work</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Story</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"faq.html\\\">Help</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <h1>Reserve your spot</h1>\\n      <p class=\\\"meta\\\">Choose a public gathering or request private sessions. We offer 1:1, couples, and small-group corporate experiences.</p>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <form action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"get\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"booking-form\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1\\\">\\n          <label for=\\\"type\\\">Session type</label>\\n          <select id=\\\"type\\\" name=\\\"type\\\">\\n            <option>Public sound bath</option>\\n            <option>1:1 private session</option>\\n            <option>Couples session</option>\\n            <option>Corporate / team session</option>\\n          </select>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"width:220px\\\">\\n          <label for=\\\"date\\\">Preferred date</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"date\\\" name=\\\"date\\\" type=\\\"date\\\" aria-label=\\\"Preferred date\\\" />\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"row\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <label for=\\\"name\\\">Your name</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Full name\\\" required />\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\" required />\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <label for=\\\"notes\\\">Notes & accessibility</label>\\n        <textarea id=\\\"notes\\\" name=\\\"notes\\\" rows=\\\"4\\\" placeholder=\\\"Let us know about mobility, sensitivities, or questions.\\\"></textarea>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <section style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"flow\\\">\\n        <h3 id=\\\"flow\\\">What to expect — the flow</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"footnote\\\">Sessions typically follow this tempo: arrival and settling (10–15m), opening tonality and breathwork (5–8m), main soundscape (30–40m) — often featuring bowed instruments like the monochord, soft crystal bowls, and chimes — and a gentle integration period (5–10m). Timing adapts to the room.</p>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n        <h3>What to bring</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"footnote\\\">Mat or blanket, a pillow/bolster for neck support, layered clothing, water, and an eye covering if desired. If traveling for a private session, consider yoga props for comfort.</p>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n        <h3>Health & safety</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"footnote\\\">Contraindications include epilepsy, recent surgery, and certain implanted devices. If in doubt, consult your medical provider and reach out to us at {{EMAIL}} before booking.</p>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center\\\">\\n        <button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"btn\\\">Proceed to Reserve</button>\\n        <a href=\\\"faq.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">See full FAQs</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </form>\\n\\n    <aside style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <h4>Private sessions</h4>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Options include 60–90 minute 1:1 sessions, intimate couples work, and tailored corporate experiences focusing on relaxation and team cohesion. Instruments in private work rotate — tuning forks, soft gongs, and warm steel tongue drums are often used to support specific outcomes.</p>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">For group bookings, email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> or call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a>.</p>\\n    </aside>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer style=\\\"text-align:center;color:#9fb0bf;padding:22px\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{VENUE_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
        }
      ],
